1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,854
Api terbesar yang pernah

2
00:00:01,874 --> 00:00:03,015
dinyalakan kaumnya justru

3
00:00:03,035 --> 00:00:04,188
tidak membakar.

4
00:00:04,208 --> 00:00:05,628
Satu perintah turun:

5
00:00:05,648 --> 00:00:06,665
wahai api,

6
00:00:06,685 --> 00:00:07,711
jadilah dingin.

7
00:00:07,731 --> 00:00:09,212
Nabi Ibrahim tumbuh di tengah

8
00:00:09,232 --> 00:00:10,358
kaum penyembah patung,

9
00:00:10,378 --> 00:00:11,907
termasuk ayahnya sendiri.

10
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:12,889
Ia bertanya:

11
00:00:12,909 --> 00:00:14,685
patung apa yang kalian sembah

12
00:00:14,705 --> 00:00:15,925
dengan tekun ini?

13
00:00:15,945 --> 00:00:16,971
Jawab mereka:

14
00:00:16,991 --> 00:00:18,349
kami mendapati nenek moyang

15
00:00:18,369 --> 00:00:19,403
kami menyembahnya.

16
00:00:19,423 --> 00:00:21,075
Surah Al-An'am mencatat cara

17
00:00:21,095 --> 00:00:22,928
Ibrahim mengajak berpikir.

18
00:00:22,948 --> 00:00:24,278
Bintang terbenam.

19
00:00:24,298 --> 00:00:25,396
Bulan terbenam.

20
00:00:25,416 --> 00:00:27,041
Matahari pun terbenam.

21
00:00:27,061 --> 00:00:28,186
Yang tenggelam tidak pantas

22
00:00:28,206 --> 00:00:28,888
disembah.

23
00:00:28,908 --> 00:00:30,188
Ia menghadap Pencipta langit

24
00:00:30,208 --> 00:00:30,844
dan bumi.

25
00:00:30,864 --> 00:00:33,034
Suatu hari kaumnya pergi.

26
00:00:33,054 --> 00:00:33,963
Ibrahim mendatangi

27
00:00:33,983 --> 00:00:35,247
berhala-berhala itu dan

28
00:00:35,267 --> 00:00:35,960
bertanya:

29
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:37,316
kenapa kalian tidak makan?

30
00:00:37,336 --> 00:00:38,542
Kenapa tidak menjawab?

31
00:00:38,562 --> 00:00:39,362
Lalu ia menghancurkan

32
00:00:39,382 --> 00:00:40,941
semuanya, kecuali yang paling

33
00:00:40,961 --> 00:00:41,536
besar.

34
00:00:41,556 --> 00:00:42,232
Kaumnya marah:

35
00:00:42,252 --> 00:00:43,580
siapa yang melakukan ini?

36
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:44,679
Ibrahim menjawab:

37
00:00:44,699 --> 00:00:46,057
tanyakan saja pada patung yang

38
00:00:46,077 --> 00:00:46,908
besar itu,

39
00:00:46,928 --> 00:00:48,351
kalau mereka bisa bicara.

40
00:00:48,371 --> 00:00:49,311
Mereka tertunduk.

41
00:00:49,331 --> 00:00:49,821
Mereka tahu,

42
00:00:49,841 --> 00:00:51,310
patung tidak bisa bicara.

43
00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:52,208
Kalah berdebat,

44
00:00:52,228 --> 00:00:53,616
mereka memilih kekerasan.

45
00:00:53,636 --> 00:00:54,344
Bakarlah dia,

46
00:00:54,364 --> 00:00:55,397
kata mereka.

47
00:00:55,417 --> 00:00:57,185
Sebuah bangunan didirikan,

48
00:00:57,205 --> 00:00:58,578
api dinyalakan,

49
00:00:58,598 --> 00:00:59,832
dan Ibrahim dilemparkan ke

50
00:00:59,852 --> 00:01:00,799
dalamnya.

51
00:01:00,819 --> 00:01:02,518
Lalu Allah berfirman:

52
00:01:02,538 --> 00:01:03,679
wahai api,

53
00:01:03,699 --> 00:01:04,918
jadilah dingin,

54
00:01:04,938 --> 00:01:07,579
dan keselamatan bagi Ibrahim.

55
00:01:07,599 --> 00:01:09,886
Itu surah Al-Anbiya ayat enam

56
00:01:09,906 --> 00:01:10,937
puluh sembilan.

57
00:01:10,957 --> 00:01:11,990
Yang hendak mencelakainya

58
00:01:12,010 --> 00:01:13,677
justru menjadi orang-orang

59
00:01:13,697 --> 00:01:14,843
yang paling rugi.

60
00:01:14,863 --> 00:01:16,024
Keyakinan yang lahir dari

61
00:01:16,044 --> 00:01:17,712
berpikir tidak padam oleh api.

62
00:01:17,732 --> 00:01:18,563
Menurut kamu,

63
00:01:18,583 --> 00:01:20,452
kebiasaan apa yang masih kita

64
00:01:20,472 --> 00:01:22,216
ikuti hanya karena semua orang

65
00:01:22,236 --> 00:01:23,178
melakukannya?

